-- training_sample: 2,000 random filings from the "Residuals and Predictions" sheet. That sheet stored
-- e^days, so values were converted back to days with ln(); 377 rows that overflowed to Inf were skipped.
-- app_users, projects and forecasts are example rows for the app skeleton.

